{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "slug": "icon-swap",
  "title": "Icon swap",
  "group": "Microinteractions",
  "order": 5,
  "summary": {
    "en": "One glyph turns into another in place: the old one shrinks to half and blurs away while the new one settles on a snappy spring. For icons that say a new state (copied, playing, saved), not for decoration.",
    "id": "Satu glyph berubah menjadi glyph lain di tempatnya: yang lama mengecil ke setengah dan memudar kabur, sementara yang baru mendarat dengan spring yang sigap. Untuk ikon yang menyatakan status baru (tersalin, diputar, tersimpan), bukan untuk hiasan."
  },
  "titleId": "Icon swap",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Copy, then copied",
        "desc": "Press copy: the icon becomes a check and the label says Copied, then both come back after 1.6 s.",
        "html": "<div class=\"codeblock\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 420px;\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span>Install</span><button class=\"btn btn--plain btn--sm\" data-lds-copy=\"npm install lampung-design-system\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">content_copy</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\">check</span></span><span data-lds-copy-label=\"Copied\">Copy</span></button></div><pre>npm install lampung-design-system</pre></div>\n<button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy the invitation link\" data-lds-copy=\"https://example.id/musrenbang/way-halim\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">link</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\">check</span></span></button>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Play and pause",
        "desc": "A public briefing recording. The icon is the state, so it swaps; the label follows for screen readers.",
        "html": "<button class=\"icon-btn icon-btn--accent\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Play recording\" onclick=\"this.querySelector('.swap').classList.toggle('is-swapped'); const p = this.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true'; this.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(p)); this.setAttribute('aria-label', p ? 'Pause recording' : 'Play recording');\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">play_arrow</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\">pause</span></span></button>\n<span class=\"card__sub\">Regional tax briefing, 48 min</span>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Save for later",
        "desc": "Bookmarking a service: the outline swaps to the filled icon. Quiet on purpose; there is no count and no burst.",
        "html": "<button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Save service\" onclick=\"this.querySelector('.swap').classList.toggle('is-swapped'); const p = this.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true'; this.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(p)); this.setAttribute('aria-label', p ? 'Saved service' : 'Save service');\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">bookmark</span><span class=\"ic ic--fill swap__b\">bookmark</span></span></button>\n<button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show password\" onclick=\"this.querySelector('.swap').classList.toggle('is-swapped'); const p = this.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true'; this.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(p)); this.setAttribute('aria-label', p ? 'Hide password' : 'Show password');\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">visibility</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\">visibility_off</span></span></button>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Salin, lalu tersalin",
        "desc": "Tekan salin: ikon menjadi centang dan labelnya berbunyi Disalin, lalu keduanya kembali setelah 1,6 detik.",
        "html": "<div class=\"codeblock\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 420px;\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span>Instalasi</span><button class=\"btn btn--plain btn--sm\" data-lds-copy=\"npm install lampung-design-system\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">content_copy</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\">check</span></span><span data-lds-copy-label=\"Disalin\">Salin</span></button></div><pre>npm install lampung-design-system</pre></div>\n<button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Salin tautan undangan\" data-lds-copy=\"https://example.id/musrenbang/way-halim\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">link</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\">check</span></span></button>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Putar dan jeda",
        "desc": "Rekaman sosialisasi. Ikonnya adalah status, jadi ikon itu bertukar; labelnya ikut berubah untuk pembaca layar.",
        "html": "<button class=\"icon-btn icon-btn--accent\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Putar rekaman\" onclick=\"this.querySelector('.swap').classList.toggle('is-swapped'); const p = this.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true'; this.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(p)); this.setAttribute('aria-label', p ? 'Jeda rekaman' : 'Putar rekaman');\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">play_arrow</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\">pause</span></span></button>\n<span class=\"card__sub\">Sosialisasi pajak daerah, 48 menit</span>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Simpan untuk nanti",
        "desc": "Menandai sebuah layanan: ikon garis bertukar ke ikon terisi. Sengaja tenang; tanpa jumlah dan tanpa ledakan.",
        "html": "<button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Simpan layanan\" onclick=\"this.querySelector('.swap').classList.toggle('is-swapped'); const p = this.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true'; this.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(p)); this.setAttribute('aria-label', p ? 'Layanan tersimpan' : 'Simpan layanan');\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">bookmark</span><span class=\"ic ic--fill swap__b\">bookmark</span></span></button>\n<button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Tampilkan kata sandi\" onclick=\"this.querySelector('.swap').classList.toggle('is-swapped'); const p = this.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true'; this.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(p)); this.setAttribute('aria-label', p ? 'Sembunyikan kata sandi' : 'Tampilkan kata sandi');\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">visibility</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\">visibility_off</span></span></button>"
      }
    ]
  },
  "related": [
    "copy-button",
    "icon-button",
    "toggle",
    "text-morph"
  ]
}
